\title{betaLB: Likelihood-Based Confidence Intervals for Regression Effect Sizes}
\author{Ivan Jacob Agaloos Pesigan}
\date{}

\begin{document}

\maketitle

\section*{Description}

Generates profile likelihood confidence intervals
for standardized regression coefficients (beta) and other effect sizes,
including multiple correlation, semipartial correlations,
improvement in R-squared, squared partial correlations,
differences in standardized regression coefficients,
and Cohen's f-squared,
for models fitted by \texttt{lm()}.

\section*{Installation}

You can install the development version of \texttt{betaLB} from
\href{https://github.com/jeksterslab/betaLB}{GitHub}
with:

%% begin.rcode
% #| eval = FALSE
% if (!requireNamespace(package = "pak", quietly = TRUE)) {
%   utils::install.packages(pkgs = "pak")
% }
% pak::pkg_install(pkg = "jeksterslab/betaLB")
%% end.rcode

\section*{More Information}

See
\href{https://jeksterslab.github.io/betaLB/index.html}{GitHub Pages}
for package documentation.

